# Deny everything, then allow only the published set.
# A blocklist misses whatever arrives next. This cannot.
*

# Repository front matter
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!README.md
!REPORT_SCHEMA.md
!app.py
!build_dataset.py
!tests_source_matches_repo.py
!requirements.txt

# Published directories and their contents
!gyms/
!gyms/**
!kernel-nki/
!kernel-nki/**
!kernel-rocm/
!kernel-rocm/**
!dashboard/
!dashboard/**
!reports/
!reports/**
!dataset/
!dataset/**

# Working material inside those directories stays out
gyms/**/.venv/
gyms/**/.docker-tmp/
kernel-nki/*.tgz
kernel-rocm/*.md
kernel-rocm/*.o
kernel-rocm/harness
kernel-rocm/harness_*.json
kernel-rocm/ref_dump.bin
dashboard/*.png
reports/_*.json

# Build products
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
